   "lines": [
    "Alice, Rosy and Rose",
    "went back to Oyster",
    "Bay with us; we",
    "reached it late in",
    "the evening. My cart",
    "arrived safely with",
    "the horse.",
    "Looking back at",
    "my college career it",
    "is very pleasant to",
    "feel that there is",
    "nothing I should",
    "care to change in",
    "it; my career (both",
    "in and out of college)",
    "has been more suc-",
    "cessful than that",
    "of any man I",
    "have known."
   ],
